_vrf_PLAT975_u-luu84             
;
PROBLEM: Check Calcd Resid. Dens. 0.41A From O2 3.25 eA-3
RESPONSE: Due to the uranium atom, common for heavy atoms 
to have high residual q-peaks that are very close.
;
_vrf_PLAT220_u-luu84             
;
PROBLEM: NonSolvent Resd 1 O Ueq(max) / Ueq(min) Range 10.0 Ratio
RESPONSE: Due to positional/site occupancy disorder of oxygen atoms 
on the sulfates, coordinating water, and solvated waters. 
Please see SI for more information
;
_vrf_PLAT306_u-luu84             
;
